{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06361","headline":"送司农崔丞 · 李颀","name":"送司农崔丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鹂鸣官寺，香草色未已。\n同时皆省郎，而我独留此。\n维监太仓粟，常对府小史。\n清阴罗广庭，政事如流水。\n奉使往长安，今承朝野欢。\n宰臣应记识，明主必迁官。\n塞外貔将虎，池中鸳与鸾。\n词人洞箫赋，公子鵕䴊冠。\n邑里春方晚，昆明花欲阑。\n行行取高位，当使路傍看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}